  "/api/sessions/01a30000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001/plan": {
   "content": "# Plan: Redis rate limiter\n\n## Goal\n\nLimit each API key to a fixed number of requests per window, shared across all API nodes.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Spike a token bucket on Redis (`INCR` + `PEXPIRE` in one `MULTI`).\n2. Add `rateLimit()` middleware with a per-route override.\n3. Integration tests against a real Redis in CI.\n4. Document the tuning knobs.\n\n## Risks\n\n- Clock drift between nodes: the window lives in Redis, not on the node.\n- Redis down: fail open and log, so checkout keeps working.\n",
   "path": "/home/dev/code/acme-api/_plans/rate-limiter.md"
  },
