   "id": "01a30000-0000-7000-8000-000000000102",
   "title": "Tuning knobs",
   "key": "knobs",
   "kind": "markdown",
   "content": "| Knob | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `RATE_WINDOW_MS` | 60000 | Window length |\n| `RATE_LIMIT` | 600 | Requests per key per window |\n| `RATE_BURST` | 50 | Extra requests in a burst |\n| `RATE_KEY_PREFIX` | `rl:` | Redis key prefix |\n",
   "file": null,
